[IMP] web, *: improve phone field widget

*: crm, hr, phone_validation, sms

This commit introduces the following improvements to the phone field:
1. It ensures that the phone field widget is applied on every phone
   field in odoo.
2. Now keep the raw user-entered phone and separate the formatted
   version in an extra field (just like the sanitize version), and allow
   the phone field widget to take profit of both (e.g. displaying the
   sanitized and formatted international version in readonly).
3. It prepares the framework code of the phone field widget to be
   overridden (e.g. voip) so it is possible to display the sanitized
   phone number. See related enterprise commit below.

